      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Given this was a recommendation from Solar Quotes, it is very disappointing Power Vault no longer exists. It doesn't say a lot of positive things about Solar Quotes. They also installed a Fronius Primo KW inverter with wireless monitoring via Solar. Web I keep getting messages saying the link between the Inverter and Solar Web is down.Tried to contact both \"Kitman\"  and \"Solar Vault\"  re this issue, only to find both groups no longer exist.  The system was installed April last year.Absolutely disgusted that gullible homeowners trying to do something for the planet are being ripped off by commercial interest who use bankruptcy to avoid consumer law.  When are governments going to do something about this?When is \"Solar Quotes\" going to filter out dodgy operators from their recommendations?",
