      "review_description": "What started out as a great build with good quality items has finished with extremely poor after installation service and now find that the holding company that I dealt with is now in non voluntary receivership although Powervault continues to trade under another holding entity. The actual installation was faulty and the cables to my batteries were melting and so the system could have exploded. All my calls and emails to continue repairing the system have gone nowhere and I am now taking the issue via Fair Trading. I would not recommend using them in the future.",
