      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Here is my advice - use another installer - ANY installer has to be better than Powervault Global. Once they have your deposit, they will do exactly nothing without being prodded from you.SolarQuotes deserves a bad word here for even having them as a \"Recommended Installer\"- Phone calls are ignored.- Emails are usually ignored.- Constant promises are made and broken - time, after time, after time, after time.- Outright lies are told to you- Mistakes are made constantly in what you ordered- Email templates are poorly worded, formatted like a 5 year old has prepared them.Don't forget, Powervault is supposed to provide after sales support! That has to be a giant joke, given my experience so far.All of these people who are commenting that \"the system is yet to be installed\" - you'll be waiting a long, long time.Don't trust them - check and double check everything - get everything in writing.I'm at the stage now of considering legal action as this is just ridiculous.",
