      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I ordered the system on August 14 and was advised that it would be about 4 weeks. This was reliant on getting approval from ACT government.I paid 10% deposit but did not receive a receipt for the deposit and no acknowledgement of the order except with what the salesperson had given me at the beginning. I rang up a couple more times to see how the progress was going and was told I would get a call from the office when the approval was given.I rang up ACT approvals about 4 weeks later to check and they said it had been approved and had been forwarded to Powervault. A couple days later I was told installation would  begin on September 25 but they were waiting for a shipment of units arriving and it could be a week later (October 2)Neither happened and I have had no contact with them. On October 1 I sent off an email to them pointing out their customer service left a lot to be desired and the least they could do was keep me informed of any changes, delays etc. I can accept that sometimes unavoidable things happen and that is life but what I cannot accept is not keeping a customer informed.",
